[ti:1-07-便条]
[00:00.00]December 24 Jack,
[00:01.61]I feel most embarrassed about referring to a rather difficult subject.
[00:08.08]I wonder if it may have slipped your mind that nearly three months ago you asked me for a loan of RMB 500.
[00:17.14]You said you would pay me back on the next payday.
[00:21.45]Is it possible that you pay it back within 2 weeks?
[00:25.88]I am sure you will agree and not be offended by my request.
[00:30.94]Here is a piece of good news for you.
[00:34.07]The Russian State Ballet,
[00:36.44]which is now on tour in Beijing,
[00:39.25]will give a performance in the National Center for the Performing Arts tomorrow evening.
[00:47.33]I am sure you will be happy to watch it.
[00:50.68]Here I leave you a ticket.
[00:52.94]The performance will begin at seven o’clock sharp.
[00:57.58]I will expect you at the theater entrance.
[01:01.35]Please let me know if you can’t make it.
